&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standort: Frankfurt / München (Hybrid) | Practice Area: Capital Markets | Anstellungsart: Unbefristet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestalte die Zukunft von Securities &amp;amp; Custody Operations im Finanzdienstleistungssektor.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als (Senior) Consultant* in unserer Capital Markets Practice arbeitest Du mit führenden Finanzinstituten zusammen, um deren Securities-, Custody- und Capital-Markets-Operations zu transformieren und zu optimieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du bringst fundierte Fachkenntnisse entlang des Wertpapier-Lebenszyklus und im Post-Trade-Umfeld mit. Gemeinsam mit unseren Kunden analysierst Du komplexe operative Herausforderungen, identifizierst Optimierungspotenziale und übersetzt Anforderungen in praxisorientierte Lösungen. Du begleitest Transformationsprogramme von der Analyse und Konzeption bis hin zur Implementierung und arbeitest dabei eng mit Stakeholdern aus Operations, Technologie und Change zusammen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was Du bei uns machst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt Transformationsinitiativen in den Bereichen Securities, Custody und Post-Trade Operations – von der Anforderungsanalyse bis zur Implementierung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du analysierst bestehende Operating Models, Prozesse und Kontrollen und identifizierst Möglichkeiten zur Vereinfachung, Optimierung und Effizienzsteigerung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest mit Stakeholdern aus Business, Operations und Technologie zusammen, definierst Anforderungen und übersetzt diese in praxisorientierte Lösungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du setzt Dein Wissen über Wertpapierprozesse ein – einschließlich Trade Lifecycle, Settlement, Asset Servicing und Custody Operations – um komplexe Herausforderungen unserer Kunden zu lösen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt die Projektdurchführung durch Workshops, Analysen, Dokumentation, Stakeholder Management und Implementierungsbegleitung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir von Dir erwarten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevante Beratungs- oder Finanzdienstleistungserfahrung in den Bereichen Securities, Custody, Post-Trade oder Capital Markets Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fundierte Kenntnisse des Wertpapier-Lebenszyklus und operativer Prozesse wie Settlement, Custody, Asset Servicing und/oder Corporate Actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in Business Transformation, Prozessoptimierung, Operating Models oder Change-Initiativen innerhalb der Finanzdienstleistungsbranche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte analytische und problemlösungsorientierte Fähigkeiten sowie die Fähigkeit, komplexe Anforderungen in klare und praxisorientierte Lösungen zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sichere Kommunikations- und Stakeholder-Management-Fähigkeiten sowie Freude an der Zusammenarbeit mit Business- und Technologie-Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Von Vorteil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung bei oder mit Global Custodians, Investmentbanken, Asset Managern, Marktinfrastrukturen oder Securities-Services-Anbietern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kenntnisse regulatorischer und branchenspezifischer Entwicklungen im Securities- und Post-Trade-Umfeld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Operating Model Design, Prozessoptimierung oder umfangreichen Transformationsprogrammen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kenntnisse von Wertpapierplattformen, Custody-Systemen oder Post-Trade-Technologien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beratungserfahrung bei der Umsetzung von Veränderungen in komplexen Finanzdienstleistungsorganisationen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum Capco?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbeite an wirkungsvol...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Skeletons, lasers, tattoo buses — the Torq brand grabs attention like nothing else in cybersecurity. And we&#39;re growing like crazy, backed by Series D funding, 200% employee growth, and 300% revenue growth. Fueling Torq&#39;s momentum is our game-changing AI SOC platform, backed by a team and culture that makes Torq one of Forbes&#39; Best Startup Employers in America, and a Business Insider &#39;startup to bet your career on&#39;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Life at Torq is all gas, no brakes. We&#39;re a team of relentless, collaborative go-getters pushing the boundaries of what&#39;s possible for security automation. Every role is an essential driver of Torq&#39;s success as the AI-native autonomous SecOps platform of choice for security teams across the Fortune 500.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over the past year, we&#39;ve built one of the fastest-growing Enterprise Sales organizations in EMEA.&amp;nbsp;Now we&#39;re looking for a hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Regional Sales Director&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;to lead our DACH and Eastern Europe business.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This isn&#39;t a role for someone who wants to manage from behind a dashboard. We&#39;re looking for a leader who enjoys being in the field, building pipeline alongside the team, partnering with customers, and helping experienced Enterprise sellers win bigger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Germany (preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Enterprise Account Executives across DACH&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;and Eastern Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the regional sales strategy and execution to achieve ambitious growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive pipeline generation, forecasting, operational excellence, and accurate sales execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with customers, Sales Engineers, Marketing, and Channel teams to accelerate strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team throughout complex enterprise sales cycles, from prospecting to closed deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new business opportunities and expand Torq&#39;s presence across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, hire, and develop top-performing Enterprise sales talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Torq at customer meetings, executive briefings, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high-performance culture built on coaching, accountability, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has 3+ years of experience leading teams of experienced Enterprise or Strategic Sales professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has previous experience as an Enterprise Account Executive selling complex cybersecurity or cloud security solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a proven track record of consistently exceeding revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is passionate about coaching, developing people, and leading from the front.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in fast-moving, high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in both German and English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Torq?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join one of the fastest-growing AI SOC companies in the market, leading one of our most strategic regions during an exciting phase of growth.&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to build a world-class team, shape the future of our DACH and Eastern Europe business, and make a significant impact on Torq&#39;s continued success.&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re excited about building teams, creating momentum, and winning together- we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&qu...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;IMPORTANT - this role is initially offered as a 24-month fixed-term contract, with the possibility of an extension depending on business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We see design as a crucial element of achieving our mission, so designers are represented at all levels, including senior leadership. As our new Senior Product Designer, you will be empowered to concentrate on design solutions for people’s needs. The design organisation is well established and our impact is highly valued. That means you will be able to fully focus on your contribution to our success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Senior Product Designer to join our Security domain. The team works to keep Vinted safe and trusted without compromising the member experience. This work goes beyond preventing fraud and abuse: you’ll also shape a new, high-impact member-facing experience that broadens how people can safely access and use Vinted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer in Security, you’ll own complex, ambiguous product problems from discovery through delivery, turning questions around trust, access, and protection into intuitive, accessible, and easy-to-use solutions. You’ll collaborate closely with product managers, engineers, researchers, data analysts, content designers, and other designers, balancing strong safeguards with clarity and ease for millions of members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional partners to be the voice of our members, define problems and goals, map flows, prototype interactions, and support the development process.&lt;/...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Fullstack Engineer to join our Actions team in building the core infrastructure that powers our plugin platform. You&#39;ll create the UI components, integration layers, and security mechanisms that enable our customers to extend the platform with custom integrations while maintaining safety and flexibility across our 1,500+ customer base. This is essential infrastructure work that shapes how our customers scale their integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;The Actions team sits at the heart of Staffbase&#39;s AI ambitions. We&#39;re the team that gives Navigator — our AI assistant and the main entry point into Staffbase — the ability to actually do things: submit a form, complete a task inside an integration, or take an action...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and grow with us! Join Flexport Germany as an Account Executive and supercharge your career!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Account Executive (ENT) is responsible for driving complex, high-value enterprise deals and establishing long-term strategic partnerships with large customers. This role owns advanced, multi-stakeholder sales cycles that often span regions, business units, and decision layers. The ENT AE operates with a high degree of autonomy, shaping deal strategy, influencing executive stakeholders, and orchestrating cross-functional teams to deliver differentiated, value-driven solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities as an&lt;strong&gt; Account Executive, ENT &lt;/strong&gt;include, but are not limited to the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Opportunity Ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and close high-value, complex enterprise opportunities, consistently meeting or exceeding individual quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strategic pipeline through self-prospecting, account planning, and SDR partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify whitespace, expansion potential, and multi-entity opportunities within target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain forecasting, opportunity hygiene, and deal governance in Salesforce (SFDC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead executive-level discovery to understand enterprise supply chain strategy, risk posture, and long-term business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex buying groups across procurement, ops, finance, IT, and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design integrated, multi-product Flexport solutions aligned to customer priorities and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Flexport as a strategic partner through compelling value narratives, business cases, and solution roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deal Strategy, Negotiation &amp;amp; Closing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end deal strategy for complex opportunities, including stakeholder mapping, decision criteria, and close plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead advanced commercial negotiation, pricing, contracts, and non-standard deal structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate internal stakeholders (Ops, Finance, Legal, Product) to progress deals efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Onboarding, Expansion &amp;amp; Relationship Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the onboarding motion, ensuring enterprise customers are set up for scalable success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain trusted relationships with senior and executive customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify expansion opportunities together with Account Management to drive sustained growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a point of escalation and strategic advisor during the customer li...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager, you will be part of a high-performing professional services team focused on evaluating how the nCino product can best meet our European clients’ needs and working with the Implementation Consultant to oversee the application of a seven-step implementation process with nCino bank and credit union customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
